WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:06.330
This is AskEU, an AI guide to healthcare
rights in the European Union.

00:00:07.341 --> 00:00:12.491
Ask about your situation in plain words, in
any of four languages.

00:00:16.667 --> 00:00:23.117
The AI finds the rules that apply, writes the
answer, and checks every fact against its
source.

00:00:23.827 --> 00:00:27.507
Every answer shows the official sources behind
it.

00:00:28.218 --> 00:00:33.228
Or start from a typical situation, like a
visit to the dentist abroad.

00:00:33.941 --> 00:00:38.651
Six common situations, each with a sourced
example answer.

00:00:39.512 --> 00:00:42.065
Planning treatment in another country?

00:00:42.125 --> 00:00:48.322
The two EU routes can pay back very different
amounts, and AskEU shows which one suits you.

00:00:49.034 --> 00:00:55.244
And there are clear limits: no diagnoses, no
guessing, no medical records.

00:00:55.957 --> 00:01:01.087
Under the hood, the AI can only use official
rules that have been checked.

00:01:01.798 --> 00:01:07.088
A reviewed rule library on one side, answers
in real time on the other.

00:01:07.802 --> 00:01:12.582
Accuracy is measured against clear targets
before the public launch.

00:01:13.295 --> 00:01:18.175
AskEU speaks English, German, Polish and
Ukrainian.

00:01:18.887 --> 00:01:25.997
Early access opens in 2027, free for
individuals. Find us at ask.eu.com.
